The plugins `scrollbox` no longer receives `scrollAcceleration={scrollAcceleration()}` even though `scrollAcceleration` is still computed. This looks like an unintended regression in scrolling behavior. Either pass `scrollAcceleration()` back into the `scrollbox` props or remove the unused memo.
